MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The all-weather Gorilla duct tape feels like a natural next choice because I have chosen Gorilla tape more than once, and weather resistance adds a useful property for exposed repairs.",
    "Waterproof terminals complement my earlier crimp connectors, while the epoxy putty fits the practical sealing work suggested by my clamps and repair adhesive purchases."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The washers require a specific size and project, and the small gloves require a known fit; neither follows simply from my interest in repair supplies.",
    "General super glue, mounting foam tape, and spray bottles do not match a task I currently have. Sharing a broad repair or household purpose is not enough for me to choose them."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My adhesive purchases seem to have been taken as interest in almost any adhesive, although sealing, bonding vinyl, and mounting trim serve different needs.",
    "My past purchases of supply assortments and bulk tape seem to have been stretched into a general appetite for large quantities, even when fit or immediate usefulness is uncertain."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "I care about the repair function: weather protection and secure electrical connections make a stronger match than a loose resemblance to something I bought.",
    "Related items can compete for the same need. I would choose versatile duct tape over four specialized sealing rolls, and a broad terminal assortment over another kit focused on splices."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognized my practical repair interests but sometimes missed the specific task, compatibility, and quantity that determine whether I would choose an item now."
}
